5) Polymorphism
-Polymorphism is ability to have more than one forms.
-Entity is single but behaving differently in different context.

🌍 Real-World Example
    Scan QR → UPI
    Insert card → Card payment
    Cash → Cash payment
    interface PaymentMethod {
        fun pay(amount: Double)
    }

    class UpiPayment : PaymentMethod {
        override fun pay(amount: Double) {
            println("UPI Payment")
        }
    }

    class CardPayment : PaymentMethod {
        override fun pay(amount: Double) {
            println("Card Payment")
        }
    }

    class CashPayment : PaymentMethod {
        override fun pay(amount: Double) {
            println("Cash Payment")
        }
    }

